e/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4992430,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4992430-1846651706691409","game_id":"steam-4992430","kind":"announcement","title":"MOLTYN is in Steam Next Fest","summary":"MOLTYN is part of Steam Next Fest from 19 to 26 October, and the free demo is ready to play right now. You're a superhero in a world where everything can break. Melt it, flood it, freeze it, throw it. Every building comes down a little differently. In the demo: 5 story missions, including a city-sized kaiju and a fight against a copy of yourself 7 superpowers, from laser and gravity to freezing water and calling lava A full sandbox island to wreck however you like Plays great on Steam Deck I'm a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691409","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4992430-1845383656396324","game_id":"steam-4992430","kind":"announcement","title":"The free MOLTYN demo is out now","summary":"The free MOLTYN demo is out now on Steam. Grab it from the demo page or the Download Demo button on the MOLTYN store page.You're a volcanologist who got a bit too close to a volcano and came out with every power of the earth. Fly straight through the mountain, cut it apart with the laser, flood the town, freeze the sea, and when things have already gone badly, there's the nuke.The demo is also in Steam Next Fest, 19 to 26 October.Early Access follows on 12 November 2026 with 10 story missions, t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T12:54:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396324","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4992430-1844751498234209","game_id":"steam-4992430","kind":"announcement","title":"Free MOLTYN demo on Steam, 6 October","summary":"The free MOLTYN demo lands on Steam on Tuesday 6 October.You're a volcanologist who got a bit too close to a volcano and came out with every power of the earth. The demo drops you on a volcanic island with a town on its slopes and lets you loose: fly straight through the mountain, cut it apart with the laser, flood the town, freeze the sea, and when things have already gone badly, there's the nuke.The demo is also in Steam Next Fest, 19 to 26 October.Early Access follows on 12 November 2026 with","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T13:13:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234209","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4992430-1844115010494920","game_id":"steam-4992430","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest weekend is live NOW!","summary":"If you requested access, MOLTYN Playtest is in your Steam library now. If you haven't, hitRequest Access on the store page (the green button in the \"Join the MOLTYN Playtest\" box) andSteam will let you know when you're in.Two things I'm asking of every tester:1. Report any bugs. The fastest way is in the game: press F2 (or the FEEDBACK button, bottom left) the moment something goes wrong. It sends your note with a screenshot and the technical details attached, so I can find it. Crashes, freezes,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T14:04:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010494920","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4992430-1843481262697354","game_id":"steam-4992430","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest signups are open","summary":"The MOLTYN playtest is now taking signups. Hit Request Access on the store page (the green button in the \"Join the MOLTYN Playtest\" box) and you're in the queue. Access goes out as soon as the build clears Steam review. The playtest shows up in your library as MOLTYN Playtest. What you'll be testing: the current build of the game. Dig, blast, pour lava, bring the place down, and tell me what broke, what felt good and what you'd change. Expect rough edges, and please report them. Where to talk: t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T12:00:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697354","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4992430-1841579228677279","game_id":"steam-4992430","kind":"announcement","title":"The MOLTYN demo hits Steam next week","summary":"Every rock, drop and flame in MOLTYN is real, simulated matter and next week you get to break it yourself!The free demo is days away: one island, seven powers, a couple of baddies, and a world that actually obeys physics. Cut a cliff and it falls. Pour lava and it cools to obsidian. Charge a water blast and the pool comes with you.Wishlist the full game so the demo finds you the moment it's live:Andrew (the whole current dev team)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T04:54:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677279","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4992430":{"last_atte